<title>NORWAY: Bergesen fixes T/C for gas tankers - sources.</title>
<headline>Bergesen fixes T/C for gas tankers - sources.</headline>
<dateline>OSLO 1997-04-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Norway's Bergesen d.y. ASA has fixed five of its 75,000 cbm gas tankers on time charters from six to 12 months, an industry source said on Monday.</p>
<p>The rate per ship is from $650,000 to $700,000 per month, the source told Reuters.</p>
<p>All of Bergesen's large gas tankers are now fixed for the rest of 1997, the source said.</p>
<p>--Oslo newsroom, Ole Petter Skonnord +47 22 93 69 72</p>
